WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 2.3 · Theory of Change
Long-term impact

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Impact is the long-term change you contribute to, not one you cause alone.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Start from your vision and first external objective.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Name whose lives or which conditions improve.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Say who else shapes the change.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Tide Line Youth Collective (Community group · idea stage, Indonesia)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Over ten years or more, contribute to healthier mangrove coasts in two North Bali villages, with less erosion, cared for by local young people.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You write your impact statement and who else influences it.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
